oming to the party last night.\n                        Katie   Yes, | was intending to, but right at the last minute something\n\n                        Maya    Oh,     Well, you must come next time.\n\n             6.3    Rewrite the underlined words in these emails giving advice, using phrasal verbs with come.\n\n               eco.                                        Sa                     Reply           Forward\n               | know that you are having to deal with a lot of problems at work every day at the moment, but\n               don't worry, they're only temporary, and I've heard that a new job opportunity is going to arise,\n               which could change  things completely. Whenever your name_is mentioned in conversation,\n               everyone  always speaks very highly of you.\n\n\n               eco                                         M4)                    Reply          Forward\n               You think you have someone met  by pure chance  who seems  to share the same world view as\n               you, but be careful, | don't think she is what she seems to be. Don't forget that, in the end, true\n               love is mainly about finding someone you can trust.\n\n\n                                                                 English Phrasal Verbs in Use Intermediate  17", "char_count": 3261, "mean_conf": 89.82, "word_count": 411, "words": [{"text": "Exercises", "x0": 428, "y0": 144, "x1": 781, "y1": 211, "conf": 96, "bold": false}, {"text": "6.1", "x0": 280, "y0": 347, "x1": 354, "y1": 387, "conf": 90, "bold": true}, {"text": "Complete", "x0": 425, "y0": 353, "x1": 620, "y1": 396, "conf": 88, "bold": false}, {"text": "these", "x0": 632, "y0": 354, "x1": 744, "y1": 390, "conf": 96, "bold": false}, {"text": "sentences", "x0": 757, "y0": 359, "x1": 959, "y1": 393, "conf": 96, "bold": false}, {"text": "with", "x0": 971, "y0": 357, "x1": 1062, "y1": 394, "conf": 90, "bold": false}, {"text": "a", "x0": 1076, "y0": 368, "x1": 1097, "